{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d1041df6-5bf1-87ba-aadd-4b1191770d2e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:45:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peggy Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:41:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:41:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good afternoon. I am calling because my bin, the recycling bin, it is missing after the pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, your recycling bin is gone after the pickup. Let me get some details. Which day was your pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Was this morning. I put the bin on the curb last night, and now [inaudible] no bin. Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up a little there. You put it out last night and this morning it's not there. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. And is the second time in a row. Two weeks ago also, the bin was missing. So two pickups, two times missing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two pickups in a row, same thing. Got it. What's the address where the bin was?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "354 Spring Street. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "354 Spring Street. Let me read that back so I have it right, three five four Spring Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is it. Three five four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:42:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Was it a city bin, the kind the city gave out, or one you bought yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:43:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...the city one, the blue. It has the number on the side, I think. Sorry, you can repeat the question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:43:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I asked if it was the blue one the city gave you. You're saying yes, it's the city one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:43:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the city one. Blue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:43:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Did you look around the street, maybe the truck left it down the block or a neighbor's yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:43:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I looked on my street, both sides, and also the corner. Nothing. I walked until the end of the block."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:43:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, you've already checked. I'll put in a request for a replacement bin and note that this is the second missed one. Is there a way I can reach you if the crew has to confirm anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:43:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one six nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:43:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one six nine. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:44:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:44:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, I'd also say, if you can, look on our website for the form so it's on record. Do you have a computer at home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:44:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, at home I don't have. I use the computers at the public library. It is near, so is okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:44:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. The library can help you find the trash and recycling page. But I'm entering the request from here now, so you don't have to do anything extra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:44:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. So you are putting the request, and the new bin comes to my house. I understand correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. The request goes to the crew that handles bins, and they deliver the replacement to 354 Spring Street. Usually it takes a few days to a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:44:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days to one week. Okay. And for the next pickup, what I do? I put the trash only?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:44:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Put out your regular trash as usual. For the recycling, if the bin hasn't come by then, you can use a sturdy box or bag and set it by the curb, and mention it's recycling on the side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:45:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a box with the word recycling. Good. I do this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:45:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:45:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:45:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:45:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
